Rules:
  [S1] Use bundles for modularity.
  [S2] Use Doctrine ORM for database.
  [S3] Use Twig for templating.
  [S4] Use dependency injection.
  [S5] Use Symfony Security for auth.
  [S6] Use Symfony Forms for validation.
  [S7] Use Messenger for async.
  [S8] Use API Platform for REST/GraphQL.

